-*   Transfer function: Maps scalar values to RGBA color and opacity, typically stored as a 1D texture (`sampler1D`) or 2D texture (`sampler2D`) [S1, S2, S4, unofficial].
-*   Camera parameters: Projection matrix, view matrix, and eye position [S2, S4, unofficial].
-*   Bounding box geometry: A cube defined by 8 vertices in object coordinates $[0,1]^3$ and 36 indices defining 12 triangles [S4, unofficial].
-
-**Outputs:**
-*   Final image: Rendered to the default framebuffer or a target texture [S1, S4, unofficial].
